  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How do I view the journal entries that are saved as draft?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 18 Nov, 2021 at  2:33 PM\n\n\t\tNavigation: Bookkeeping > Select Client > Tasks > Journals\n\nDraft journals will appear in \"Red\". \n\nPlease select edit from the action dropdown, and then balance the journal\n\nYou may view the journal entries under Task>>Journals section and you need to balance the journal entry amounts to reflect on the trial balance. \n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to see also how to delete a journal entry\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do I view the journal entries that are saved as draft?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 18 Nov, 2021 at  2:33 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Navigation: Bookkeeping &gt; Select Client &gt; Tasks &gt; Journals</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Draft journals will appear in \"Red\".</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please select edit from the action dropdown, and then balance the journal</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You may view the journal entries under Task&gt;&gt;Journals section and you need to balance the journal entry amounts to reflect on the trial balance.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br>Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073987914/original/HK9YvRfYX4qFa5EATHtph3_oGb6-mV2k9A.png?1553252829\" width=\"500\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073987914/original/HK9YvRfYX4qFa5EATHtph3_oGb6-mV2k9A.png?1553252829\" data-fileid=\"9073987914\" data-uniquekey=\"1553252820234\" style=\"width: 1103px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/653373ebef7a4be98d02ec1056fb0972\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Click here to see also how to delete a journal entry</strong></span></a></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165345\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165345/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165345\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165345/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\"